---
error: cannot connect to 172.17.0.1

  request: GET /api/v1/repos/fclitest/agit
  host:    172.17.0.1
  port:    39683
  cause:   received corrupt message of type InvalidContentType

what to do:
  the server replied with HTTP, but fcli used HTTPS.
  1. use an explicit HTTP address:
     fcli auth login --host http://172.17.0.1:39683
  2. check the server response:
     curl -sS -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\n' http://172.17.0.1:39683/api/v1/version
  note: non-loopback hosts default to HTTPS. Use http:// only if the
        server requires it.
